      "returnType": "template<MatrixType> template<ResultType> void MatrixPower<MatrixType",
      "docs": "\\brief Compute the matrix power.\n\\param[in]  p    exponent, a real scalar.\n\\param[out] res  \\f$ A^p \\f$ where A is specified in the\nconstructor."
    },
